   _hook_: '*'
+# Break ACTION-level repetition loops (identical Bash calls repeated with no
+# state progress). This is a COMPACTION-SAFE drop-in replacement for the stock
+# LoopDetectionProcessor (same _singleton_group="loop_detection", _order=20).
+#
+# Why the replacement: the stock processor fully clears its fingerprint window
+# on every compaction-driven message drop (>= compaction_drop_threshold). When
+# the agent is stuck emitting the SAME Bash call repeatedly, each repeated turn
+# re-narrates and re-grows the context, which itself trips CompactionProcessor
+# — so the reset wipes the in-progress identical run before the consecutive
+# counter can reach `threshold`, silently defeating the detector. Verified on
+# this benchmark: tasks issued 9-33 byte-identical consecutive calls yet NO task
+# ever produced a clean `loop_detected` exit; they burned the whole step budget
+# (budget_exceeded/error) instead, and the warn-nudge never reached the agent.
+#
+# The fix preserves ONLY the trailing consecutive run across a compaction reset
+# (dropping older heterogeneous fingerprints, which was the real stale-false-
+# positive risk the reset targeted), so a genuine loop still accumulates toward
+# threshold and the warn escalation still reaches the model.
+#
+# Knobs are recalibrated for this Bash-only agent:
+#   - warn_threshold=8: injects "you are stuck, try something different" starting
+#     at 8 consecutive identical calls — now reaches loop tasks that compaction
+#     previously silenced, while tolerating short legit repeats.
+#   - threshold=30 raises LoopDetectedError -> graceful `loop_detected` exit; set
+#     ABOVE the observed recover-after-loop ceiling (task_000936 PASSED after 26
+#     identical calls then recovered) so a recovering loop is never cut short,
+#     while the pathological 30+ non-recovering loops get their budget reclaimed.
+#   - window_size=40 > threshold so the consecutive-run tail can reach 30.
+#   - name_warn_threshold=999 disables Strategy 2 (a Bash-only agent issues many
+#     legit consecutive Bash calls with varying args).
+- _target_: file:///fsx/home/jixuan.chen/harnessx-backup/recipe/tb2_evolver/runs/tmax-coev-rep14-i2/_meta_v2/R4/c6/processors/loop_detection_compaction_safe.py::CompactionSafeLoopDetectionProcessor
+  window_size: 40
+  warn_threshold: 8
+  threshold: 30
+  name_warn_threshold: 999
+  compaction_drop_threshold: 5
+  _hook_: '*'
 - _target_: harnessx.processors.control.compaction.CompactionProcessor